@TicTacToe.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080

### E1: create a game (mode: TwoPlayer or VsComputer)
# @name createGame
POST {{TicTacToe.Api_HostAddress}}/api/games
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mode": "TwoPlayer" }

### E2: read the game
@gameId = {{createGame.response.body.$.id}}
GET {{TicTacToe.Api_HostAddress}}/api/games/{{gameId}}
Accept: application/json

### E3: play a move (0-based row/col)
POST {{TicTacToe.Api_HostAddress}}/api/games/{{gameId}}/moves
Content-Type: application/json

{ "player": "X", "row": 0, "col": 0 }

### E3 (invalid): row outside 0..2 → 400 OUT_OF_BOUNDS
POST {{TicTacToe.Api_HostAddress}}/api/games/{{gameId}}/moves
Content-Type: application/json

{ "player": "O", "row": 3, "col": 0 }

### E4: undo the last move
POST {{TicTacToe.Api_HostAddress}}/api/games/{{gameId}}/undo

### E5: reset the game (same id and mode)
POST {{TicTacToe.Api_HostAddress}}/api/games/{{gameId}}/reset

### E6: read the scoreboard
GET {{TicTacToe.Api_HostAddress}}/api/scoreboard
Accept: application/json

### E7: reset the scoreboard
POST {{TicTacToe.Api_HostAddress}}/api/scoreboard/reset

### OpenAPI document (Development only)
GET {{TicTacToe.Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json
